s:3239:"<div class="no-overflow"><p>Le Wright Flyer est l'avion avec lequel les frères Wright effectuent les premiers vols contrôlés et motorisés de l'histoire de l'aviation, à Kitty Hawk en Caroline du Nord le 17 décembre 1903. </p>
<div class="infobox_v3 infobox infobox--frwiki noarchive">
<div class="entete" style="background-color:#94b8cf;color:#ffffff;">
<div><i>Flyer</i></div>
</div>
<div class="images"><span class="mw-default-size"><img class="mw-file-element img-fluid" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/First_flight2.jpg/250px-First_flight2.jpg" alt="Description de l'image First flight2.jpg." width="250" height="162" /></span></div>
<div class="hr" style="height:2px;"> </div>
<table><caption style="background-color:#94b8cf;color:#ffffff;">Données clés</caption>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th scope="row">Constructeur</th>
<td><span class="flagicon"><span class="mw-image-border noviewer"><img class="mw-file-element img-fluid" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a4/Flag_of_the_United_States.svg/20px-Flag_of_the_United_States.svg.png" alt="" width="20" height="11" /></span></span> Frères Wright</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row">Type</th>
<td>Prototype</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row">Premier vol</th>
<td>17 décembre 1903</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<table><caption style="background-color:#94b8cf;color:#ffffff;">Motorisation</caption>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th scope="row">Moteur</th>
<td>Wright (4 cyl.) entraînant deux hélices</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row">Puissance</th>
<td>9 kW / 12 <abbr class="abbr" title="cheval-vapeur">ch</abbr></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<table><caption style="background-color:#94b8cf;color:#ffffff;">Dimensions</caption>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th scope="row">Envergure</th>
<td>12,29 <abbr class="abbr" title="mètre">m</abbr></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row">Longueur</th>
<td>6,43 <abbr class="abbr" title="mètre">m</abbr></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row">Hauteur</th>
<td>2,74 <abbr class="abbr" title="mètre">m</abbr></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row">Surface alaire</th>
<td>47,5 <abbr class="abbr" title="mètre carré">m<sup>2</sup></abbr></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row">Nombre de places</th>
<td>1 pilote</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<table><caption style="background-color:#94b8cf;color:#ffffff;">Masses</caption>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th scope="row">Masse à vide</th>
<td>274 <abbr class="abbr" title="kilogramme">kg</abbr></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<th scope="row">Masse maximum</th>
<td>338 <abbr class="abbr" title="kilogramme">kg</abbr></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="mw-empty-elt"></p>
<table><caption style="background-color:#94b8cf;color:#ffffff;">Performances</caption>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th scope="row">Vitesse maximale <small>(VNE)</small></th>
<td><span title="11,944 454 m/s">43</span> <abbr class="abbr" title="kilomètre par heure">km/h</abbr></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p class="navbar bordered noprint"><span class="plainlinks navigation-not-searchable"><br /></span> <img class="mw-file-element img-fluid" src="//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/38/Info_Simple.svg/20px-Info_Simple.svg.png" alt="" width="12" height="12" /></p>
</div>
<p></p></div>";